@startuml Filter和Interceptor执行流程时序图
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title Filter和Interceptor执行流程（包含异常处理场景）

actor 客户端 as Client
participant "FirstFilter" as F1
participant "SecondFilter" as F2
participant "ThirdFilter" as F3
participant "DispatcherServlet" as DS
participant "FirstInterceptor" as I1
participant "SecondInterceptor" as I2
participant "ThirdInterceptor" as I3
participant "Controller" as Ctrl

== 场景1: 正常流程（无异常） ==
Client -> F1: HTTP请求
activate F1
note right of F1: FirstFilter\n前置处理

F1 -> F2: chain.doFilter()
activate F2
note right of F2: SecondFilter\n前置处理\n(无异常)

F2 -> F3: chain.doFilter()
activate F3
note right of F3: ThirdFilter\n前置处理

F3 -> DS: chain.doFilter()\n进入DispatcherServlet
activate DS
note right of DS: DispatcherServlet\n查找Handler

DS -> I1: preHandle()
activate I1
note right of I1: 返回true\n继续执行
I1 --> DS: true
deactivate I1

DS -> I2: preHandle()
activate I2
note right of I2: 返回true\n继续执行\n(无异常)
I2 --> DS: true
deactivate I2

DS -> I3: preHandle()
activate I3
note right of I3: 返回true\n继续执行
I3 --> DS: true
deactivate I3

DS -> Ctrl: 调用Controller方法
activate Ctrl
note right of Ctrl: 处理业务逻辑
Ctrl --> DS: 返回结果
deactivate Ctrl

DS -> I3: postHandle()
activate I3
note right of I3: 倒序执行\npostHandle
deactivate I3

DS -> I2: postHandle()
activate I2
deactivate I2

DS -> I1: postHandle()
activate I1
deactivate I1

DS -> I3: afterCompletion(null)
activate I3
note right of I3: 倒序执行\nafterCompletion\nex=null
deactivate I3

DS -> I2: afterCompletion(null)
activate I2
deactivate I2

DS -> I1: afterCompletion(null)
activate I1
deactivate I1

DS --> F3: 返回响应
deactivate DS

note right of F3: ThirdFilter\n后置处理
F3 --> F2: 返回
deactivate F3

note right of F2: SecondFilter\n后置处理
F2 --> F1: 返回
deactivate F2

note right of F1: FirstFilter\n后置处理
F1 --> Client: HTTP响应
deactivate F1

== 场景2: SecondFilter抛出异常 ==
Client -> F1: HTTP请求\n(throwFilterException=true)
activate F1
note right of F1: FirstFilter\n前置处理

F1 -> F2: chain.doFilter()
activate F2
note right of F2: SecondFilter\n前置处理
note over F2 #red: 抛出ServletException!

F2 --> F1: 抛出异常
deactivate F2
note right of F1: FirstFilter\n捕获异常\n(catch块)

F1 --> Client: 错误响应\n(500错误)
deactivate F1
note over F3,Ctrl #lightgray: ThirdFilter、DispatcherServlet、\n拦截器、Controller都不会执行

== 场景3: SecondInterceptor抛出异常 ==
Client -> F1: HTTP请求\n(throwInterceptorException=true)
activate F1
note right of F1: FirstFilter\n前置处理

F1 -> F2: chain.doFilter()
activate F2
note right of F2: SecondFilter\n前置处理\n(无异常)

F2 -> F3: chain.doFilter()
activate F3
note right of F3: ThirdFilter\n前置处理

F3 -> DS: chain.doFilter()
activate DS
note right of DS: DispatcherServlet\n查找Handler

DS -> I1: preHandle()
activate I1
note right of I1: 返回true
I1 --> DS: true
deactivate I1

DS -> I2: preHandle()
activate I2
note right of I2: 检测参数
note over I2 #red: 抛出Exception!

I2 --> DS: 抛出异常
deactivate I2

note right of DS: DispatcherServlet\n捕获异常\n触发异常处理

DS -> I1: afterCompletion(exception)
activate I1
note right of I1: 只有已执行\npreHandle的\n拦截器才调用\nafterCompletion\nex!=null
deactivate I1

DS --> F3: 返回(异常)
deactivate DS
note over I2,Ctrl #lightgray: SecondInterceptor的afterCompletion、\nThirdInterceptor、Controller不会执行

note right of F3: ThirdFilter\n后置处理\n(正常执行)
F3 --> F2: 返回
deactivate F3

note right of F2: SecondFilter\n后置处理\n(正常执行)
F2 --> F1: 返回
deactivate F2

note right of F1: FirstFilter\n后置处理\n(正常执行)
F1 --> Client: HTTP响应
deactivate F1

@enduml
